#pad(left: 2em)[
(i) $overline(overline(A)) = overline(A)$;\
(ii) $overline(A ∪ B) = overline(A) ∪ overline(B)$;\
(iii) $A ⊂ overline(A)$;\
(iv) $overline(∅) = ∅$.
